      "text": "✦ Demo · Posts and profiles stay in this browser. ✎ Edit page content directly ✎ Edit NEXORA TOUCH COMMUNITY Salon transfers Owners can list a salon for transfer. Buyers can browse or post what they are looking for. This section is separate from Jobs. ＋ List a salon ⌕ Post buying interest 🏪 List my salon Add details, photos and transfer terms. ✍️ Write salon story Build a draft from your details. 📚 View examples Start from a template, then add real details. 🗂️ My listings 0 active listings Listing templates for owners These templates guide your writing. Replace every [placeholder] with real details before saving. CONTENT TEMPLATE 💅 Nail salon A guide for nail services, location, equipment and transfer terms. Use this template → CONTENT TEMPLATE ✨ Spa / beauty A guide for a spa, hair salon or beauty business. Use this template → CONTENT TEMPLATE 🏪 Other shop A flexible guide for shops, restaurants and other trades. Use this template → Transfer and buying board Illustrations are labeled SAMPLE. Your listings stay in this browser. All For sale Buyers My listings ⌕ Search 🏪 For sale SAMPLE Nail salon for sale in Richmond ⌖ Richmond, TX Tiệm nail mẫu Richmond Nail salon Operating salon with regular customers and convenient parking. 👁 151 sample views $145,000 Details Demo contact 🏪 For sale SAMPLE Salon transfer in Sugar Land ⌖ Sugar Land, TX Tiệm nail mẫu Sugar Land Nail salon Spacious salon for a buyer who wants to continue operating an existing business. 👁 152 sample views $210,000 Details Demo contact 🏪 Looking to buy SAMPLE Looking to buy a nail salon in Houston ⌖ Houston, TX Nail salon Interested in an operating salon, preferably with an existing team. 👁 153 sample views Budget to discuss Details Demo contact 🏪 For sale SAMPLE Sample spa studio in Houston ⌖ Houston, TX Tiệm spa mẫu Spa / beauty A sample spa listing showing services, real photos, floor area, lease terms and contact details. 👁 154 sample views Sample asking price Details Demo contact Sample listings only demonstrate the interface. Verify pricing and details before any transaction. ✦ Ask AI assistant List a salon for transfer VI × Listing builder Choose a template or enter real details, then build a draft. Replace all [placeholders] before saving. 💅 Nail salon ✨ Spa / beauty 🏪 Other shop Listing type Transfer / Sell salon Looking to buy Trade / business type Nail salon Spa / beauty Hair salon Restaurant Retail shop Other trade Salon name * Area * Title * Address or approximate area (optional) Size in ft² (optional) Stations / chairs Rent / lease terms (optional) Equipment and assets included Reason for transfer (optional) Asking price Contact name * Phone (optional) Email (optional) Salon description / story ✍️ Build draft Real salon photos (up to 3, 500 KB each) This prototype only saves in the browser. Contact details appear in the demo listing; review them before saving. ✦ Ask AI Cancel Save listing",
